  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.12.0\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\n### New Features 🎉\n* Update correspondence integration by @MagnusHAa in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1715\n* feat: add EnforceDataTypeTaskId setting and implement access checks in DataElementAccessChecker by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1723\n* Add web hook support for nets by @bjorntore, @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1599\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* Fix issue where serviceowner tokens were classified as  by @martinothamar in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1707\n* Fix binary compatibility for IDataClient and IInstanceClient by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1711\n* Make component expressions subform aware by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1698\n* Fix issue with broken RemoveHiddenData when a whole page is hidden by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1721\n### Dependency Upgrades 📦\n* Update github/codeql-action digest to 5c8a8a6 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1603\n* Update actions/setup-dotnet digest to c2fa09f by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1631\n* Update dependency JsonPatch.Net to v4 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1620\n* Update actions/setup-java digest to be666c2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1646\n* Update actions/cache digest to 6682284 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1652\n* Update actions/checkout digest to de0fac2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1653\n* Update dependency Altinn.ApiClients.Maskinporten to v10 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1654\n* Update nuget non-major dependencies (patch) by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1732\n## New Contributors\n* @MagnusHAa made their first contribution in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1715\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.11.0...v8.12.0",
